  "description": "EAN/UPC family logical pattern vectors: gs1-barcode-engine ean.c UNIT_TESTS (commit 289c899, 2024-09-26) and GS1 General Specifications 26.0 section 5.2 worked examples. modules: 1 = dark module, 0 = light module, quiet zones excluded. widths: element widths in modules starting with a bar.",
