   "docs/specifications/data/repos/gs1-barcode-engine-master-289c899-2024-09-26.tar.gz src/c-lib/ean.c",
   "docs/specifications/gs1-general-specifications-v26.0.pdf section 5.2"
  ],
  "notes": [
   "engineRender.row is the expected raster row from the engine test, X = dark; the engine pads every symbol with 7X light on both sides, which is not the GenSpecs Table 5-11 quiet zone for EAN-13 (11/7), UPC-A (9/9) or UPC-E (9/7)",
   "GenSpecs prints no module patterns; genspecs:* modules are computed from Tables 5-3 to 5-9 and the figure examples were checked against the rasterised figure bars",
   "gtin14 is the AI (01) form the library ElementString holds",
   "upce-compress vectors: input is the engine string with X as check digit placeholder; gtin12 replaces X with the real check digit"
  ],
  "research": "docs/superpowers/research/2026-10-11-m4-ean-upc.md",
  "extracted": "2026-10-11"
